    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking a favour",
     "texto": [
      "To ask someone to do something for you, use **-아/어 주세요** (would you be so kind as to…).",
      "It is added to the verb stem: 찍다 → **찍어 주세요**, 기다리다 → **기다려 주세요**, 말하다 → **말해 주세요**.",
      "It is what you would say in the street to ask «take my photo», «wait for me» or «tell me», but more politely."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
